  "description": "\"Did you just do it?\" \n\n'Was it... this big?' \n\nMirang, an eight-tailed fox who couldn't become a nine-tailed fox, had many complaints. She believed she deserved to be the owner of the mountain, but Muwon, a tiger who settled in Mokcheong Mountain later than her, brazenly snatched the position of 'Mountain Lord'. Mirang plots, temporarily drives Muwon out of Mokcheong Mountain, and revels in her reclaimed position as mountain owner. \n\nHowever, Muwon immediately returns, enraged, and the two resume their fierce battle. Yet, a subtle tension begins to flow between them. \n\n\"They say moon rabbits are the best for 'hitting rice cakes' (a euphemism for sex), but a fox and a tiger are no less impressive. Olssu!\"\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://ridibooks.com/books/5285002396)",
